      <div class="problem__cards">
        <div class="problem__card">
          <div class="problem__card-number">01</div>
          <p class="problem__card-text">"You picked a career at 18 with almost no real experience of what different fields actually feel like."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem__card">
          <div class="problem__card-number">02</div>
          <p class="problem__card-text">"You studied what seemed safe. Or what your parents suggested. Or what sounded impressive at dinner tables."</p>
        </div>
        <div class="problem__card">
