  <!-- ══ HOW IT WORKS ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">The Solution</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="how-heading">One year. Three phases.<br><em>Infinite possibility.</em></h2>
      <div class="phases">

        <div class="phase">
          <div class="phase__number" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
          <div class="phase__content">
            <div class="phase__tag">Months 1 — 3</div>
            <h3 class="phase__title">Explore.</h3>
            <p class="phase__body">Ten skills are randomly assigned to you from our library of thirty. One week per skill. No overthinking, no safe choices — just genuine exposure to things you might never have chosen yourself.</p>
            <ul class="phase__list" aria-label="Phase 1 includes">
              <li>10 randomised skills</li>
              <li>Pre-recorded weekly modules</li>
              <li>One live expert session per skill</li>
              <li>Community skill forum access</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase">
          <div class="phase__number" aria-hidden="true">02</div>
          <div class="phase__content">
            <div class="phase__tag">Months 4 — 6</div>
            <h3 class="phase__title">Discover.</h3>
            <p class="phase__body">Ten more skills from the remaining twenty. By now, signals are emerging. Pay attention to the skill that made you feel most alive — the one that made the week disappear.</p>
            <ul class="phase__list" aria-label="Phase 2 includes">
              <li>10 more randomised skills</li>
              <li>20 skills explored in total</li>
              <li>Your personal ikigai map builds</li>
              <li>Peer accountability groups</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase phase--gold">
          <div class="phase__number" aria-hidden="true">03</div>
          <div class="phase__content">
            <div class="phase__tag">Months 7 — 12</div>
            <h3 class="phase__title">Master.</h3>
            <p class="phase__body">You choose two skills and go all in. Six months of real depth, real proficiency, and a structured monetisation roadmap to help you turn what you love into how you live.</p>
            <ul class="phase__list" aria-label="Phase 3 includes">
              <li>2 chosen skills, deep focus</li>
              <li>Advanced expert curriculum</li>
              <li>1-on-1 mentorship available</li>
              <li>Monetisation workshop</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══ EXPERIENCE ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">The Experience</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="experience-heading">
      What happens after you join?
    </h2>

    <div class="experience__steps">
      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Start with reflection.</h3>
        <p>You answer a short onboarding questionnaire so Random Ten understands your interests, fears, strengths, and current direction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Receive your first 10 skills.</h3>
        <p>Your first phase gives you 10 beginner-friendly skill challenges from the Random Ten library.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Try one skill at a time.</h3>
        <p>Each challenge includes a simple task, reflection prompt, and scoring system so you can test the skill without feeling overwhelmed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Score what feels natural.</h3>
        <p>You rate each skill on enjoyment, difficulty, natural ability, curiosity, and monetisation potential.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>05</span>
        <h3>Find your strongest two.</h3>
        <p>After exploration, you identify the two skills that feel most aligned and worth developing further.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="experience__step">
        <span>06</span>
        <h3>Build a real direction.</h3>
        <p>The final phase helps you go deeper, build a portfolio, and explore realistic ways to monetise your strongest skills.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

